  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for Code 39 from Word is a C# barcode scanner library to read, scan Code 39 barcode from Word in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example C# source code to scan, read, decode Code 39 data message from Word file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/csharp_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
